  "description": "Retrospective application for the retention of an extractor fan and flue system to the front elevation.",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The approved fume/odour extraction filtration system shall be retained and maintained as recommended by the supplier/manufacturer for the duration of its use and in accordance with the approved details. Maintenance records must be kept and presented for inspection upon request by an Environmental Protection Officer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Reason: In order to safeguard the amenity of neighbouring occupiers in terms of the smells/odours from cooking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Noise levels from fixed plant and machinery associated with the proposed development shall be 10dB(A) or more below the background noise level when measured at 1m from any nearby noise sensitive premises at any time; and the fixed plant and machinery shall be retained and maintained as recommended by the supplier/manufacturer for the duration of its use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; &quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Reason: To protect the amenities of adjoining occupiers and the surrounding area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
